<title>SINGAPORE: Lindeteves-Jacoberg in power contract.</title>
<headline>Lindeteves-Jacoberg in power contract.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified engineering and trading company Lindeteves-Jacoberg Ltd said on Wednesday it had agreed to supply power to a company in Manila.</p>
<p>The contract with Holland Pacific Paper Inc. will involve an estimated investment of Singapore $3 million, financed by internal sources and bank borrowings, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The supply of power will begin in August 1998. It gave no further details</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
